<title>JAPAN: Aomori Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aomori Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    33.92		vs	   37.73</p>
<p> Operating	    7.12		vs	    6.38</p>
<p> Current		4.29		vs	    5.37</p>
<p> Net		    3.65		vs	    2.74</p>
<p> EPS		   19.44 yen	  vs	   14.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    188 million	  vs	 188 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Aomori Bank Ltd is a regional bank in Aomori.</p>
</text>
